id=apex_burp_ca
name=Burp CA into APEX (Android 14+)
version=v2.6
versionCode=17
author=VxU
description=Injects PortSwigger/Burp CA into the conscrypt APEX trust store (all apps) AND the user trust store (Chrome/Chromium, CT-exempt) at post-fs-data before zygote. v2.4 hardens apply(): persistent system-CA baseline + staging + count guard + post-bind verify/rollback, so a runtime re-apply can never drop the system roots (no more "all apps: no internet"). Green glassy WebUI: Control, Certs (view/import/delete, no openssl), Verify (per-app trust check), Log. Firefox needs a one-time about:config toggle.
